# PostMan -> 

Postman is a collaboration tool 
Postman is a free API testing tool that lets you send HTTP requests (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, etc.) and inspect the responses from your server or APIs.

Send requests

Add headers (like Content-Type, Authorization)

Send request bodies (JSON, form data, files)

Save and organize requests in collections

Test APIs easily during development

# Why use Postman?

Quickly check if your API routes (/api/cars, /api/users) are working
Debug what your server is receiving (req.body, headers, params, etc.)
Simulate frontend requests (before you build the frontend)
Test error cases (e.g., missing data, wrong method)
Automate API testing (Postman scripts)



